cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the Dream-RSI paper and this implementation."
title: "Dream-RSI: recursive self-improvement through evolving worlds (Hermes integration)"
abstract: >-
  Independent implementation of the Dream-RSI framework (arXiv:2609.14858):
  a completed discovery history becomes a replay simulator in which candidate
  exploration policies are improved by dreaming, then redeployed online. Ships a
  standalone CLI, a Hermes native tool, deterministic offline mode, and tasks for
  math optimisation, algorithm engineering and real-repository hot paths.
